\n- Researched companies related to embedded systems and electronics.\n- Collected information about company services and technical domains.\n- Reviewed PCB design, embedded hardware, IoT, and automation-related services.\n- Organized the collected information for documentation.', E'admin', E'approved', E'gkbharath', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'2026-10-27T11:32:08.861Z', E'2026-10-30T09:13:44.653Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO "requests" ("id", "submissionId", "type", "title", "createdBy", "createdByUsername", "createdById", "createdByRole", "createdByDesignation", "createdByEmployeeId", "createdByDepartment", "createdByPhone", "payload", "remarks", "target", "status", "forwardedTo", "uploadedFile", "signatureFrom", "signatureStatus", "officialDocument", "circular", "createdAt", "updatedAt") VALUES (E'3955', E'6250', E'attendance-report', E'Attendance report: 2026-10-27 to 2026-10-27', E'VISHNU VARSHINI M', E'vishnuu', E'SMIB-EMP-5c6151ea-f197-40ad-9eb4-69cc3e1cd5e3', E'employee', E'PCB & EMS/IoT Designer-T', E'MIB05', E'PCB Designs & Fabrication Team', E'6380551370', '{"fromDate": "2026-10-27", "toDate": "2026-10-27", "remarks": "DAILY WORK REPORT\nDate: 27 October 2026\n\nDIN-Rail Industrial IoT Controller \u2013 Requirement Analysis\n\nReviewed the project requirements for the industrial IoT controller.\n\nExamined the proposed scope covering schematic design, PCB layout, firmware development, prototype fabrication, and testing.\n\nConsidered the initial prototype quantity of 5\u201310 units and the subsequent production batch of 60 units.\n\nQuotation Preparation\n\nPrepared a preliminary quotation document for the DIN-Rail Industrial IoT Controller project.\n\nOrganized the project scope and deliverables for quotation submission.\n\nIdentified the need for final technical confirmation before preparing the final quotation.\n\nTechnical Clarifications\n\nClarified points regarding universal input channels, analog and digital inputs, relay output ratings, power supply and other requirements for industrial controller project\n\nFunctional blocks preparation\n\nWorked on preparing the functional block and the respective components required to build the schematic for SSR based motor starter project.", "daysRecorded": 1, "attendance": [{"id": "ac72454a-6f65-4963-8370-290bd823b22a", "userId": "SMIB-EMP-5c6151ea-f197-40ad-9eb4-69cc3e1cd5e3", "username": "vishnuu", "fullName": "VISHNU VARSHINI M", "employeeId": "MIB05", "date": "2026-10-27", "checkIn": "2026-10-27T03:21:40.243Z"}], "approvalChain": ["hareeshv", "santhanakumarv", "gkbharath"], "currentApproverIndex": 2, "comments": [{"by": "gkbharath", "comment": "", "decision": "approve", "stageIndex": 2, "at": "2026-10-28T03:10:53.695Z"}, {"by": "santhanakumarv", "comment": "", "decision": "approve", "stageIndex": 1, "at": "2026-10-28T03:10:07.173Z"}, {"by": "hareeshv", "comment": "", "decision": "approve", "stageIndex": 0, "at": "2026-10-27T12:01:21.650Z"}]}'::jsonb, E'DAILY WORK REPORT\nDate: 27 October 2026\n\nDIN-Rail Industrial IoT Controller – Requirement Analysis\n\nReviewed the project requirements for the industrial IoT controller.\n\nExamined the proposed scope covering schematic design, PCB layout, firmware development, prototype fabrication, and testing.\n\nConsidered the initial prototype quantity of 5–10 units and the subsequent production batch of 60 units.\n\nQuotation Preparation\n\nPrepared a preliminary quotation document for the DIN-Rail Industrial IoT Controller project.\n\nOrganized the project scope and deliverables for quotation submission.\n\nIdentified the need for final technical confirmation before preparing the final quotation.\n\nTechnical Clarifications\n\nClarified points regarding universal input channels, analog and digital inputs, relay output ratings, power supply and other requirements for industrial controller project\n\nFunctional blocks preparation\n\nWorked on preparing the functional block and the respective components required to build the schematic for SSR based motor starter project.', E'admin', E'approved', E'gkbharath', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, E'2026-10-27T11:12:31.494Z', E'2026-10-28T03:10:53.696Z') ON CONFLICT ("id") DO NOTHING;
